## uc--new

Scaffold a new use-case folder under `data/<uc>/`.

- pick `<uc>` id (folder name, e.g. `uc09`) + label + optional description
- create:
  - `use-case.json` = `{ label, description? }` (no id field — folder name wins)
  - `structure.json` = `[]` (empty `StructureColumn[]`)
  - `data-sources/` (empty)
  - `runs/v1/run.json` = `{ date: <today>, notes? }`
- competitor folders are not pre-created — added as runs are collected
- `bun run check` after

